<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s299S">Suppose <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s299w1">moreover</span> that there were <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w6">no</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w3"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s299w4">pus</span> and <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s299w5">blood</span></span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s299w2">out there to appear as</span> the pus and blood, and suppose that the <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s299w9">mere</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w8">appearance</span> of something <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s299w7">looking like pus and blood</span> could ever <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s299w13">function</span> as something to <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w10"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s299w11">eat</span> or <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s299w12">drink</span></span>. Well then, you would also have to be able to use a comb on the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w19">hair</span> that <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w20">appears</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s299w18">on</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w17">porcelain sink</span> to a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w14">person <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s299w16">with</span> <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s299w15">cataracts</span></span>. <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s299w21">And</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w24">horsefly</span> that <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w23">appeared</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s299w22">to the same person</span> would have to be able to give him a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w25">bite</span>. <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s299w26">And</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w28">water</span> of a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w27">mirage</span> would have to <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w31">provide</span> all the normal <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w30">functions</span> of <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w29">water</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w32">and so on</span>. Why so? Well <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s299w50">because</span>, according to you, there is <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w37">no</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w34"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s299w35">pus</span> and <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s299w36">blood</span></span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s299w33">out there to appear as</span> pus and blood; according to you, the <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s299w43">mere</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w42">appearance</span> of something <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w41">looking like</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w38"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s299w39">pus</span> and <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s299w40">blood</span></span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w49">can</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w48">provide</span> all the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w47">functions</span> of things that you <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s299w44"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s299w45">eat</span> and <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s299w46">drink</span></span>.</span>
</div>
